+- `evidence/preflight-rerun.log`,
+  `evidence/preflight-rerun-pinned.log`, and
+  `evidence/preflight-rerun-configured.log`: retained failed setup attempts.
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
